# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Bulk data lives in the Zenodo record, not in git.
#
# The paths below exceed what a git repository should carry (20 files are over
# GitHub's 100 MB hard limit; together they are ~13.8 GB). They are NOT missing
# from the release -- they are deposited in the companion data record, under
# these exact paths. See "Where the files are" in README.md.
#
# Ignoring them here means `git add -A` yields the ~186 MB code repository
# without any manual pruning.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Model checkpoints (1.1 GB each)
*.pt

# Metadynamics stationary-point trajectories (8.3 GB) and the strided example run
stationary_points_src/
meta_40_stride.traj

# DFT training trajectory (159 MB) and the worked VASP example (453 MB)
DFT_Dataset/train/
DFT_Dataset/VASP-input/

# Per-component benchmark error tables (1.7 GB) and force parity plots (1.3 GB)
all_force_component_errors.csv
*forces_components.pdf

# Per-system MLIP prediction trajectories (0.57 GB)
uma.traj

# Superseded 8-system benchmark run
backup/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Housekeeping
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
._*

# Zenodo staging area (~14 GB of archives) and any local API tokens
_zenodo_upload/
*.token
token-*
